{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id196621573"}, "name":{"label":"Early Urdu"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-08-24T04:35:33-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.5.4"}, "id":{"label":"14466092256"}, "title":{"label":"Absolutely wonderful"}, "content":{"label":"The number of daily planners, schedulers and other such apps I have purchased over the years are nothing compared to this spectacular app, and it is spectacular. Its versatility and overall usability are second to none. I particularly love the focus feature which is insanely useful, the bright and colourful choices you can pick are awesome and make a stunning view of your day. It really does ‘structure’ your day in a way no other app has ever managed to achieve. In fact calling this wicked piece of software an ‘app’ is underselling it, this is a groundbreaker, one day all apps will be built just like this one. Thank you developers, your design is amazing and perfect. Thank you so much.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id14853125"}, "name":{"label":"Mishmish08"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-08-24T00:58:22-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.5.4"}, "id":{"label":"14465549655"}, "title":{"label":"Important features missing"}, "content":{"label":"I thought I had finally found my perfect task management app, but sadly not.  \n\nUnfortunately there is no facility to allocate a priority to tasks.  A key part of time management is capturing the tasks that need doing and being able to prioritise them BEFORE you schedule them in your day.  This app jumps straight into scheduling without giving a system for choosing which tasks are actually needed.   In an ideal world you should be able to set up a system for how you prioritise your tasks (there are a variety of different ways), and view your tasks in a priority view THEN schedule. Apps like tick tick or todoist do this very well but don’t have the visual appeal of Structured.  I would totally switch if the task capturing and prioritisation side of Structured was improved.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
