{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id1067368597"}, "name":{"label":"R7BYW"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-08-05T15:39:57-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.5.3"}, "id":{"label":"14392670327"}, "title":{"label":"Have used for 11 months consistently"}, "content":{"label":"i never write reviews but i am because i love this app so much. once i get all my tasks onto structured, i realise how much free time i actually have, which has relieved a lot of stress at times when i have thought i don’t have enough time to do everything. I use structured as a college student not only for revision and homework but also every day things, i would struggle to live without it, i recommend this app to lots of my friends, I’ve never had any major problems with it, i think it has really developed my ability to time manage, its so easy to move things around which i love. i used to use a notebook to write stuff like homework in and then put into it but now i just put it in straight away because its so quick. favourite app, honestly, i said before if i invented an app i wouldn’t want it to be like instagram or something id want it to be structured, just because its so helpful. i would get the plus but i don’t really need to connect to ai and the other things arnt really necessary, it would be more appealing if it added more to it, though its great in a way that it doesn’t because it shows how much you get with it for free.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id1607724524"}, "name":{"label":"zer0_spider"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-08-03T18:07:50-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.5.3"}, "id":{"label":"14384879565"}, "title":{"label":"Feature request: activity vault or presets"}, "content":{"label":"I have the paid version and I would love for the app to include a customizable presets section. I think it can help more for organisation rather than the “suggestions” features that appear when you want to add a task. For people who don't plan their week in advance and prefer to organize their day as it unfolds, having a vault of frequent activities would be very helpful. It would allow users to easily select and arrange their tasks to fit their mood and energy levels each day, encouraging daily use", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
