{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id113984649"}, "name":{"label":"Ashara2026"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-06-05T22:55:22-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.5.0"}, "id":{"label":"14149522645"}, "title":{"label":"ADHD coach approved!"}, "content":{"label":"As a psychologist with ADHD specialising in ADHD I’m always looking out for new productivity tools. As it happens this is the latest and greatest instantiating  of something that I’ve been using for years. I remember this where it was a lot more basic – this is all singing and dancing now and it works really well. Absolutely one of my favourites when I need to plan my day and just get stuff done. I would highly recommend it.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"4"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"4"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id42576514"}, "name":{"label":"aochoa"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-06-02T04:49:02-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.4.9"}, "id":{"label":"14134884342"}, "title":{"label":"Good concept, but persistent freezing makes it unreliable"}, "content":{"label":"I'm a paying annual subscriber and genuinely like what Structured is trying to do. The timeline view is thoughtful and the sync across devices works well, when the app is actually running.\n\nThe problem is that on macOS the app freezes regularly and stops responding entirely. The only fix is a Force Quit. This has happened often enough that I no longer trust the app to be open when I need it. For a daily planner, that's a serious reliability issue.\n\nI'd also encourage the developer to revisit what data is being sent to third-party services:\nposthog.com\n8-lives-cat.io\nrevenuecat.com\nconfigcat.com\nsentry.io\n\nAs a paying customer I was surprised to find the app contacts analytics platforms in the background,the kind of behavioural tracking that makes sense for a free app trying to convert users, less so for an annual subscription.\n\nI want to keep using Structured. But the freezing needs to be fixed, and paying users deserve transparency about what the app is doing in the background.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
